00:49:06,990 --> 00:49:08,930
From Johannes to Amanda Nikolai.

866
00:49:09,150 --> 00:49:09,630
Dearest.

867
00:49:10,110 --> 00:49:11,230
Thank you for the package.

868
00:49:11,530 --> 00:49:13,430
I'm saving the chocolate for a special occasion.

869
00:49:13,790 --> 00:49:15,710
And I'm keeping the photo close to my heart.

870
00:49:16,530 --> 00:49:19,370
It's been weeks now since I've been called for any combat action.

871
00:49:19,550 --> 00:49:22,070
But a new kind of fear is spreading inside the bunker.

872
00:49:22,650 --> 00:49:24,210
Last night I woke with a chill.

873
00:49:24,470 --> 00:49:27,030
A strange sound was emanating from deeper in the bunker.

874
00:49:27,330 --> 00:49:28,590
A kind of moan.

875
00:49:28,830 --> 00:49:29,710
A cry.

876
00:49:30,230 --> 00:49:31,230
Perhaps a howl.

877
00:49:31,230 --> 00:49:35,290
I went to investigate and found myself standing at the entryway to the Roman tunnels.

878
00:49:35,650 --> 00:49:37,130
The sound came from inside.

879
00:49:37,710 --> 00:49:40,750
I dared not shine a light inside for fear of what I might see.

880
00:49:41,230 --> 00:49:42,190
And then...

881
00:49:42,670 --> 00:49:45,990
A scrambling thudding came racing towards me from the darkness.

882
00:49:46,770 --> 00:49:48,870
A shape loomed up out of the shadows.

883
00:49:49,250 --> 00:49:51,610
I reached for my sidearm, ready to fire.

884
00:49:52,150 --> 00:49:53,010
It was Toussaint.

885
00:49:53,770 --> 00:49:55,070
He'd been awakened as well.

886
00:49:55,610 --> 00:49:57,730
But unlike me, he dared to enter the tunnels.

887
00:49:58,090 --> 00:49:59,750
He says he saw something there.

888
00:50:00,350 --> 00:50:06,230
As we stood at that maw, listening, the howling, howling, howling, grew distant.

889
00:50:06,930 --> 00:50:08,390
Receded to where I dare not guess.

890
00:50:09,010 --> 00:50:11,850
Perhaps our minds are gone, or perhaps there is something down there.

891
00:50:12,610 --> 00:50:13,930
Toussaint will not tell me what he saw.

892
00:50:14,430 --> 00:50:15,670
Please write me again soon.

893
00:50:15,910 --> 00:50:16,470
Love to you.

894
00:50:16,950 --> 00:50:17,370
Johannes.

895
00:50:19,130 --> 00:50:20,030
Oh, man.

896
00:50:36,630 --> 00:50:37,890
That's a flare over there.

897
00:50:48,440 --> 00:50:49,820
Are there more lockers in here?

898
00:50:49,900 --> 00:50:50,580
There's one over there.

899
00:50:51,280 --> 00:50:52,500
Maybe I'll try and go for that.

900
00:50:54,780 --> 00:50:55,420
No, no, no, no.

901
00:50:55,460 --> 00:50:55,960
Don't worry about me.

902
00:50:56,060 --> 00:50:56,440
Don't worry about me.

903
00:50:56,560 --> 00:50:57,600
Don't, don't, don't get over here.

904
00:51:00,380 --> 00:51:00,920
Inventory full?

905
00:51:01,120 --> 00:51:01,280
Damn.

906
00:51:02,800 --> 00:51:03,120
Uh.

907
00:51:05,580 --> 00:51:06,080
Why not?

908
00:51:13,860 --> 00:51:14,180
Ammo.

909
00:51:14,560 --> 00:51:14,880
Good.

910
00:51:18,430 --> 00:51:19,810
Sorry, sorry, sorry, sorry.

911
00:51:21,230 --> 00:51:22,130
I'm sorry about that.

912
00:51:22,290 --> 00:51:23,190
Dude, maybe it's time we go back.

913
00:51:37,380 --> 00:51:38,600
Nice and easy.

914
00:51:41,950 --> 00:51:43,290
Come on, come on.

915
00:51:43,590 --> 00:51:44,790
We got some items.

916
00:51:45,210 --> 00:51:46,950
We made some progress, I guess.

917
00:51:47,610 --> 00:51:50,670
We can strategize from the administration.

918
00:51:53,170 --> 00:51:54,050
Oh, man.

919
00:52:02,960 --> 00:52:03,800
Calmly now.

920
00:52:09,970 --> 00:52:11,290
Oh, thank God.

921
00:52:13,630 --> 00:52:14,790
I gotta stop here.

922
00:52:15,550 --> 00:52:16,830
I can't, otherwise.

923
00:52:18,370 --> 00:52:18,970
This...

924
00:52:19,690 --> 00:52:21,450
is so fucking scary.

925
00:52:23,290 --> 00:52:23,890
Ah.

926
00:52:25,590 --> 00:52:27,490
Like, I am sweating.

927
00:52:28,530 --> 00:52:29,390
So much.

928
00:52:30,470 --> 00:52:31,810
I can't think straight.

929
00:52:35,220 --> 00:52:36,480
And I hear the monster.

930
00:52:36,740 --> 00:52:37,880
I'll see you next time.

931
00:52:37,980 --> 00:52:38,280
Bye-bye.

932
00:52:38,280 --> 00:52:38,460
Bye-bye.

933
00:52:38,520 --> 00:52:38,720
Bye-bye.
